    "content": "# triangular_transport_symbol_alphabet.md — substantive source view v0.2\n\nOriginal intake object: A03. Original bytes are preserved.\nPresentation class: SOURCE-LINKED RECONSTRUCTION. Physical promotion: 0. This page is newly authored from named sources; it is not the recovered historical original.\n\n## The current matching-indexed binary alphabet\n\nThe three opposite-edge matchings are A={01,23}, B={02,13}, C={03,12}. The current pair fiber Theta={0,1}^3 has eight states. S4 acts through its matching permutation onto S3. Given frame g and offset xi, the affine update is Theta+ = P_pi(g) Theta- XOR xi. The closure convention and integrity/response types must be retained; an applied xi=000 receipt is not the same as missing source custody.\n\n## Source-bound ledger entries\n\n- LEDGER:P04 \\|Theta\\| = 2^3 = 8 [EXACT_INTERNAL]. Scope: ACTIVE ROOT GENERATOR. Next gate: closure/admissibility rule must justify the unique reference state\n- LEDGER:P05 N1 = 24 * 8 = 192 [EXACT_INTERNAL]. Scope: ACTIVE / SECTION-7 DEPENDENCY. Next gate: any observable interpretation must be derived separately\n- LEDGER:P06 Delta_theta = 8 - 1 = 7 [EXACT_INTERNAL]. Scope: ACTIVE / SECTION-7 DEPENDENCY. Next gate: continue to preserve the closure-rule proof independently of downstream matches\n- LEDGER:Q194 receipt-index continuation-map cancellation = ind F_n = dim L_n^- - dim L_n^+ [EXACT_INTERNAL]. Scope: AUTO_LOCK / NET Hamming budget independent of continuation-map rank. Next gate: derive native source construction of L_n^- and L_n^+\n- LEDGER:Q195 minimal receipt-index net budget = mu_Theta,n = dim L_n^- - dim L_n^+ [EXACT_CONDITIONAL]. Scope: AUTO_LOCK CONDITIONAL / SOURCE-COMPLETE PRE-EVENT NET POLARITY AND MULTIPLICITY LAW. Next gate: held-out endpoint validation on independently sourced receipt-complete events\n- LEDGER:Q210 closed-carrier obligation nonidentifiability = current exact closed packet/support/route variables do not force omega^lat to be an output obligation [LOCKED_NO_GO]. Scope: AUTO_LOCK / CONSTITUTIVE SEMANTICS STILL REQUIRED. Next gate: held-out test or stronger source theorem\n\n## Exact source and version crosswalk\n\n- PI: Finite Tetrahedral Complexes, Skew Support Flow and Contact Readiness — https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/47121c4b2d8f472c4eaa977b475d20cc267eed3d/captures/2026-10-07T191951Z-codex-ud-bootstrap-5170f8b8/browse/dist/papers/UD_PAPER_I_REVIEW_DRAFT_v1.1.1.md; atlas view /sources/?id=PI\n- E01: UD native pre-event projection obstruction v0.1 — https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/47121c4b2d8f472c4eaa977b475d20cc267eed3d/captures/2026-10-12T014919Z-codex-native-source-97c0393f/THEOREM.md; atlas view /sources/?id=E01\n\n## Missing original and reopening condition\n\nThe original triangular-transport alphabet file is not recovered. This is the actual current pair alphabet, explicitly offered as related source material; no physical three-channel routing alphabet is inferred.\n\n## Preservation and verification\n\nOriginal SHA-256: 0da16aba90969fa5b08fce771f62dd7ee2c99fd0b033fc961241b94754b60606. Original size: 102 bytes. The original contained only a reconstructed-snapshot placeholder. Source-link presence and register coverage are checked automatically; cited scientific statements retain their original proof/review status. No new physical law, code replay, historical event or independent review is claimed.\n",
