ization and independent held-out test\n\n## Exact source and version crosswalk\n\n- A06: distinction_dynamics_manuscript.pdf — /sources/06-distinction_dynamics_manuscript.pdf; atlas view /sources/?id=A06\n- PII: Projective Reconstruction, Complex Phase Receipts and Frozen-Tree Validation — https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/47121c4b2d8f472c4eaa977b475d20cc267eed3d/captures/2026-10-07T191951Z-codex-ud-bootstrap-5170f8b8/browse/dist/papers/UD_PAPER_II_REVIEW_DRAFT_v1.1.1.md; atlas view /sources/?id=PII\n- E03: UD packet-to-switch source recovery v0.2 — https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/47121c4b2d8f472c4eaa977b475d20cc267eed3d/captures/2026-10-12T184337Z-codex-source-recovery-82f948a4/SOURCE_RECOVERY_v0.2.md; atlas view /sources/?id=E03\n- G14: UD_GOVERNANCE_CRL2_SUBDIVISION_v1.0_UPDATED_20260914.md — /sources/UD_GOVERNANCE_CRL2_SUBDIVISION_v1.0_UPDATED_20260914.md; atlas view /sources/?id=G14\n\n## Missing original and reopening condition\n\nThe original seam/modulation definition is not recovered. Link domains, codomains, coupling, phase reference, update law and a map into the current chain or pair carrier must be sourced before unifying these layers.\n\n## Preservation and verification\n\nOriginal SHA-256: f1bc7725268362c47938d5487e9463dd42b5bd210230419d1b866ceb390c1b7c. Original size: 86 bytes. The original contained only a reconstructed-snapshot placeholder. Source-link presence and register coverage are checked automatically; cited scientific statements retain their original proof/review status. No new physical law, code replay, historical event or independent review is claimed.\n",
