    "content": "Read with the static LC benchmark review. Procurement snapshots are historical; no hardware execution is reported. Governance version history is preserved. UD Partner LLM Research Governance — Mandatory Arithmetic / Context Gate Amendment v0.1 Status: ACTIVE by explicit project instruction Effective source version: UD_PARTNER_LLM_RESEARCH_GOVERNANCE_v1.2_CURRENT_SOURCE Physical promotion: 0 ============================================================ A15. MANDATORY PRE-AUTO_LOCK ARITHMETIC / CONTEXT GATE ============================================================ ARITHMETIC_CONTEXT_GATE := ACTIVE_MANDATORY PURPOSE: Before AUTO_LOCKing a substantial numerical, combinatorial, spectral, geometric, bridge, normalization, or context-label result, execute a source-bound arithmetic/context audit. This gate does not authorize numerology. Its purpose is the opposite: extract native structure before labels are assigned, while blocking untyped coincidence from becoming mechanism. CANONICAL ORDER: source-bound object -> exact form -> typed factorization -> prime/integer decomposition -> clock/Euclidean audit -> rank/multiplicity/symmetry audit -> recursion/self-similarity audit -> collision audit -> typed-map test -> context label -> AUTO_LOCK / AUTO_FREEZE / OPEN A15.1 Exact-form rule Record exact fractions, radicals, integers, characteristic factors, rank/nullity counts, and multiplicities before decimal approximation. Decimals may support engineering or empirical work but may not replace available exact forms. A15.2 Typed factorization rule Factor integers when informative, preserving source semantics. Preferred: 192 = 24_(S4) * 8_(Theta) and separately: 192 = 6_(edge fibers) * 32_(states/fiber) Blocked: equal products -> same mechanism A factorization earns context only from its upstream carrier. A15.3 Prime/integer decomposition rule Prime powers, gcds, binomial coefficients, orbit-stabilizer products, Euler decompositions, rank-nullity partitions, Hamming-shell counts, and simplex-count identities should be checked when naturally generated by the source. Do not generate arbitrary decompositions merely because a desired physical number appears nearby. A15.4 Clock arithmetic rule For structurally linked native integers, record: A = qB + r A == r (mod B) with a readable interpretation. Clock arithmetic establishes integer commensurability or residue class only. CLOCK_FIREWALL: modulus != physical period quotient != executed cycles residue != physical state zero remainder != proof of dynamical recurrence A clock comparison must state why A and B are source-linked. A15.5 Multiplicity and symmetry rule Before naming a spectral or integer sector, inspect: rank nullity eigenvalue multiplicity orbit size stabilizer size irrep / symmetry subspace degree-resolved support When a symmetry-derived label exists, use it before an intuitive or physical label. A15.6 Recursive / self-similarity scan When the source carrier is recursive, hierarchical, substitutive, or self-similar, record the exact recursion map and preserved/transformed objects. RECURSION != FRACTAL. The label “fractal” requires, as applicable: explicit iteration map nontrivial scale transformation invariant/scaling law metric or measure for a fractal-dimension claim source/dynamical law for physical interpretation Without these gates: AUTO_FREEZE physical-fractal promotion. A15.7 Collision-register rule Every repeated integer, fraction, radical, dimension, multiplicity, or factor form that may invite reuse must be checked against typed provenance. Required disposition: SAME_VALUE / DISTINCT_OBJECT SAME_SOURCE_FAMILY / DISTINCT_ROLE EXPLICIT_TYPED_MAP or OPEN Equal numbers do not merge carriers. A15.8 Label-admissibility rule A context label is admitted only when supported by at least one of: explicit carrier construction exact map equivariance orbit/stabilizer theorem invariant subspace source-derived factor boundary proven recursion relation experimentally frozen correspondence map Otherwise the label remains: CANDIDATE OPEN or AUTO_FREEZE depending on scope. A15.9 Gate certificate Every substantial AUTO_LOCK candidate in scope must retain an ARITHMETIC_CONTEXT_CERTIFICATE containing: object_id source_anchors carrier exact_forms typed_factorizations prime_integer_decompositions clock_arithmetic rank_multiplicity_symmetry recursive_structure collision_checks proposed_labels typed_map_status no-go/freeze findings physical_promotion verdict Allowed verdicts: PASS PASS_WITH_FREEZE REPAIR_REQUIRED NOT_APPLICABLE NOT_APPLICABLE is lawful for a result with no meaningful numeric, combinatorial, recursive, or labeling content, but requires one sentence stating why. A15.10 Precedence No substantial in-scope result may be AUTO_LOCKed before this gate is completed. The gate may: strengthen a context label discover a new exact theorem identify a typed collision produce a scoped no-go leave the result unchanged It may not: reverse engineer a target create a physical bridge from arithmetic resemblance override source provenance weaken AUTO_FREEZE raise physical promotion PHYSICAL_PROMOTION remains 0 unless a separate explicit bridge closes."
