    "content": "Original source and historical status labels retained. The current review qualifies model definitions, fixed-space memory, topology, storage and reproducibility. SOURCE_ADDENDUM_BURDEN_MEMORY_AS_SEMIGROUP_RETENTION_v0.2 Date: 2026-09-18 Status: ADMITTED SOURCE ADDENDUM Supersedes: v0.1 candidate as canonical historical-M proposal Physical promotion: 0 1. Scope Defines the burden breathing memory coordinate MM as persistence of a tagged burden-contrast pattern under the declared relaxational burden dynamics. It does not measure inherited stock; that role belongs to IinhI_{\\mathrm inh}. 2. Contrast state For ancestry tag aa on declared block SS, remove the conserved component: x⊥(a)=P⊥,Sb(a). x^{(a)}_\\perp = P_{\\perp,S}b^{(a)}. The projector is taken with respect to the conserved block/component mode appropriate to the declared burden operator. 3. Memory definition For reference event s0s_0 with x⊥(a)(s0)≠0, x_\\perp^{(a)}(s_0)\\neq0, define M(a)(s;s0)=∥x⊥(a)(s)∥22∥x⊥(a)(s0)∥22. \\boxed{ M^{(a)}(s;s_0) = \\frac{ \\|x_\\perp^{(a)}(s)\\|_2^2 }{ \\|x_\\perp^{(a)}(s_0)\\|_2^2 }. } If the reference contrast vanishes, x⊥(a)(s0)=0, x_\\perp^{(a)}(s_0)=0, define M(a)=0. \\boxed{ M^{(a)}=0. } 4. Relaxational law For ẋ⊥(a)=−ℒB(s)x⊥(a),ℒB(s)≽0, \\dot x_\\perp^{(a)} = -\\mathcal L_B(s)x_\\perp^{(a)}, \\qquad \\mathcal L_B(s)\\succeq0, one has dM(a)ds=−2(x⊥(a))⊤ℒB(s)x⊥(a)∥x⊥(a)(s0)∥2≤0. \\boxed{ \\frac{dM^{(a)}}{ds} = -\\frac{ 2(x_\\perp^{(a)})^\\top \\mathcal L_B(s) x_\\perp^{(a)} }{ \\|x_\\perp^{(a)}(s_0)\\|^2 } \\le0. } Hence 0≤M(a)≤1. \\boxed{ 0\\le M^{(a)}\\le1. } No separate memory-decay coefficient is allowed. 5. Source and ancestry rule New positive burden creation receives a new ancestry tag. It does not reset or increase the memory coordinate of an older tag. Source-active histories are therefore decomposed by tag/reference event rather than folded into a single untyped memory scalar. 6. Aggregate block memory When a single scalar block memory is required, aggregate only across declared active ancestry tags using their current tagged contrast powers: MS=∑a∈𝒜S∥x⊥(a)(s)∥2∑a∈𝒜S∥x⊥(a)(sa)∥2 \\boxed{ M_S = \\frac{ \\sum_{a\\in\\mathcal A_S} \\|x_\\perp^{(a)}(s)\\|^2 }{ \\sum_{a\\in\\mathcal A_S} \\|x_\\perp^{(a)}(s_a)\\|^2 } } provided the denominator is nonzero, where sas_a is each tag’s declared reference/birth event. If the denominator is zero, MS=0. M_S=0. This introduces no fitted tag weights. 7. Clock covariance If two internal clocks parameterize the same burden trajectory, memory values are identified by state, not by raw parameter label. In particular the Q162/Q163 K4 relation sslot=43snbr s_{\\mathrm slot} = \\frac43s_{\\mathrm nbr} leaves MM unchanged. 8. Governance AUTO_LOCK BURDEN_MEMORY_IS_NORMALIZED_TAGGED_CONTRAST_POWER_RETENTION_v0.2 AUTO_FREEZE protocol memory alpha as a theory constant; arbitrary exponential memory kernels; counting newly sourced burden as memory of an older tag; identifying MM with IinhI_{\\mathrm inh}; using the superseded v0.1 autocorrelation as the canonical historical MM. Physical promotion: 0."
