efinement of the existing active-capacity ratio. 5. Source-active rule External/source terms alter VV only through their effect on the current burden field and current gate state. They are not inserted as separately weighted terms inside VV. 6. Governance AUTO_LOCK BURDEN_VIABILITY_AS_RESPONSE_CAPACITY_SOURCE_ADDENDUM_v0.1 AUTO_FREEZE V=5/6V=5/6 as a universal burden value; V=g∂hardV=g_{\\partial}^{hard} except in the equal-demand special case; inserting MM or IinhI_{\\mathrm inh} into VV; arbitrary mean/min/product viability composition; physical promotion. Physical promotion: 0."
