g beyond a comparison/deformation family. burden storage as a port-Hamiltonian Hamiltonian HBH_B. additive or metric event costs on the Pachner graph. AUTO_FREEZE discrete Morse cancellation == Pachner move without proof; free Hodge-star parameters as new theory constants; Hilbert/POVM language as automatic quantum measurement; Regge action as automatically derived UD action; Γ\\Gamma-limit assumed from finite-complex numerics; support carrier identified directly with burden capacity. Bottom-line assessment The partner’s proposal is not a competing theory program. It is best understood as a mathematical hardening layer around current UD. Its biggest value is that it tells us where to stop inventing internal terminology and instead translate a UD gap into an established mathematical problem class with known theorems, baselines, and failure criteria. The most important refinement is: first define how a bistellar move changes the actual UD operators; \\boxed{ \\text{first define how a bistellar move changes the actual UD operators;} } then derive the launch law that selects a move. \\boxed{ \\text{then derive the launch law that selects a move.} } This reverses only one small part of the partner’s emphasis and produces a cleaner dependency order."
