after geometry/level propagation; Bf1,Bf2B_{f_1},B_{f_2}: delivered-flow sample hard bounds; timing hard bound or source receipt that timing is negligible; matched-level hard bounds. For each fill-window volume slope, BV̇i,r B_{\\dot V_{i,r}} is propagated with the same frozen OLS hard-bound law. Then BΔV̇i=BV̇i,0+BV̇i,1. B_{\\Delta\\dot V_i} = B_{\\dot V_{i,0}}+B_{\\dot V_{i,1}}. The conservative pump-flow state-mean hard bound remains BfiB_{f_i}; averaging does not reduce a source hard maximum error without a stochastic model. Therefore BΔqiflow=2Bfi. B_{\\Delta q_i}^{\\mathrm flow}=2B_{f_i}. The pre-leak comparator band is BR14meas=14[∑i=14BΔV̇i+2Bf1+2Bf2]. \\boxed{ B_{R_{14}}^{\\mathrm meas} = \\frac14 \\left[ \\sum_{i=1}^{4}B_{\\Delta\\dot V_i} + 2B_{f_1} + 2B_{f_2} \\right]. } Final threshold: BR14total=BR14meas+BR14leak. \\boxed{ B_{R_{14}}^{\\mathrm total} = B_{R_{14}}^{\\mathrm meas} + B_{R_{14}}^{\\mathrm leak}. } PASS iff |R14(Lehigh)|≤BR14total. \\boxed{ |R_{14}^{(\\mathrm Lehigh)}| \\le B_{R_{14}}^{\\mathrm total}. } 12. Master freeze freeze_all.py runs before scoring. It: verifies every raw/manifest/receipt file exists; verifies the canonical source-only extraction exactly matches the source columns in fill_raw.csv; validates pump calibration provenance through the already frozen source scorer; validates geometry source receipts; validates two run-specific isolation configuration receipts; validates hard-bound metrology receipts; binds all files/hashes into one MASTER_PRE_SCORE_FREEZE.json. Afterward any input mutation returns: INTEGRITY_FAIL 13. Dual implementation The package contains: run_primary.py run_independent.py The two implementations independently compute: calibrated delivered-flow states; hold storage drifts; matched-level qualification; leak allowances; fill storage rates; G14,flowG_{14,\\mathrm flow}; G14,tankG_{14,\\mathrm tank}; R14R_{14}; final hard threshold; physical comparator verdict. They must agree within frozen numerical precision. 14. Cross-platform reporter The integrated reporter accepts: an optional frozen Córdoba comparator result; the Lehigh source result; the Lehigh tank-comparator result. Cross-platform status is: INCOMPLETE DUAL_SOURCE_LAW_REPLAY_PASS ONE_SITE_PHYSICAL_COMPARATOR_PASS DUAL_PHYSICAL_COMPARATOR_REPLICATION_PASS PHYSICAL_COMPARATOR_FAIL DUAL_PHYSICAL_REPLICATION_FAIL No amplitudes are pooled. Only DUAL_PHYSICAL_COMPARATOR_REPLICATION_PASS licenses the phrase “independent cross-platform physical comparator replication” within the tested QTP scope. 15. Current execution state The package contains no real fresh Lehigh fill/hold data and no real pump calibration, geometry, or metrology receipt. Therefore: MASTER_FREEZE_WITH_CURRENT_EMPTY_TEMPLATES := SOURCE_BLOCKED REAL_LEHIGH_PHYSICAL_SCORE := NOT_RUN PHYSICAL_PROMOTION := 0"
