r post-event action as a pre-event selector. The lawful interim object is a typed source-action packet, not a scalar weighted sum. 3. Governance AUTO_LOCK ONE_PAIR_FIXED_INTEGRITY_LATENT_CROSSING_FIXES_LANE_RANK_SIGN_THEOREM_v0.1 AUTO_LOCK NO-GO INSTANTANEOUS_Q216_AT_EXACT_LATENT_ZERO_CANNOT_SELECT_CROSSING_POLARITY_v0.1 AUTO_LOCK NO-GO SIGNED_EDGE_SUPPORT_FLOW_IS_NOT_LATENT_WITNESS_RATE_THEOREM_v0.1 AUTO_LOCK O09_SOURCE_SELECTION_REQUIRES_CANONICAL_PRE_EVENT_SOURCE_TO_HODGE_INTERTWINERS_THEOREM_v0.1 AUTO_LOCK NO-GO UNNORMALIZED_SOURCE_TO_HODGE_MAPS_CAN_REVERSE_PAIRING_SOURCE_ACTION_RANKING_NO_GO_v0.1 AUTO_FREEZE ARBITRARY_WEIGHTED_SUM_OF_TYPED_PAIRING_SOURCE_ACTIONS_USED_AS_SELECTOR_v0.1 OPEN OP03 support-flow ↔\\leftrightarrow rank-flow sign bridge; canonical source-to-Hodge maps for pairing source branches; common source-action comparison normalization; physical bridge. Physical promotion remains 0. UD_O09_SOURCE_SELECTING_PAIRING_ACTION_AUDIT_v0.1.mdUD O09 Source-Selecting Pairing Action Audit v0.1 Date: 2026-09-14 Status: INTERFACE_THEOREM_PASS / CURRENT_SELECTOR_NO_GO Physical promotion: 0 0. Objective Test whether the current mainline lifted loop-history action ℐloop→Hodge \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm loop\\to Hodge} can be extended into a source-selecting action that discriminates burden-gradient, defect, boundary, and transport A2A_2-compatible pairing sources without violating existing action and causal-order no-gos. 1. Current O09 action object The current mainline action map is ℐlift=12∑ω>0aωΔϕ̃ω. \\boxed{ \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm lift} = \\frac12 \\sum_{\\omega>0} a_\\omega\\, \\Delta\\widetilde\\phi_\\omega. } For a closed history, ℐclosed=π∑ω>0nωaω. \\boxed{ \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm closed} = \\pi\\sum_{\\omega>0}n_\\omega a_\\omega. } O09 is temporally additive and covariant under the declared orthogonal Hodge intertwiners. It is a loop/Hodge history object, not a generic source-branch scalar. 2. Necessary source-selection interface Let pairing-source branch α\\alpha have native typed source carrier Xα. X_\\alpha. To compare branch α\\alpha using O09, one first needs a pre-event map Jα:Xα→ℋO09 \\boxed{ J_\\alpha: X_\\alpha \\longrightarrow \\mathcal H_{\\mathrm O09} } into the exact lifted Hodge-history carrier consumed by O09. A lawful selector therefore requires all of: typed source map JαJ_\\alpha; pre-event causality — JαXαJ_\\alpha X_\\alpha exists before the event being selected; canonical normalization — no free branch scale; carrier covariance under the branch and Hodge symmetries; common comparison type across branches; derived optimization direction — minimization/maximization cannot be chosen post hoc. Only after those gates pass may one define ℐα=ℐO09(JαXα) \\mathcal I_\\alpha = \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm O09}(J_\\alpha X_\\alpha) and compare branches. AUTO_LOCK O09_SOURCE_SELECTION_REQUIRES_CANONICAL_PRE_EVENT_SOURCE_TO_HODGE_INTERTWINERS_THEOREM_v0.1 3. Why current O09 cannot yet select the source Current source branches are typed on different carriers: burden-gradient pairing source: b→WpBG→A2⊗ℝ; b\\to W_p^{BG}\\to A_2\\otimes\\mathbb R; signed transport/support: C1C_1/Hasse-flow receipts; radial boundary anisotropy: retained mm-operator sector; defect/obstruction candidates: their own precursor carriers. No current theorem supplies canonical maps JBG,Jsupport,J∂,Jdefect J_{BG},\\quad J_{\\mathrm support},\\quad J_{\\partial},\\quad J_{\\mathrm defect} from all of these carriers into O09’s lifted Hodge-history input with fixed relative normalization. Therefore O09 has no current common branch-action comparison domain. 4. Normalization nonidentifiability theorem Suppose one introduces a linear source-to-Hodge map by hand. For branch α\\alpha, Jα↦cαJα,cα>0. J_\\alpha\\mapsto c_\\alpha J_\\alpha, \\qquad c_\\alpha>0. Since O09 is homogeneous in the injected mode amplitudes aωa_\\omega at fixed lifted phase history, ℐα↦cαℐα. \\mathcal I_\\alpha \\mapsto c_\\alpha\\mathcal I_\\alpha. Thus branch ordering is not invariant under unsourced branch normalization. Exact witness: (ℐ1,ℐ2)=(1,2) (\\mathcal I_1,\\mathcal I_2)=(1,2) gives 1<2. 1<2. Choose equally admissible unnormalized source-map scales (c1,c2)=(3,1). (c_1,c_2)=(3,1). Then (c1ℐ1,c2ℐ2)=(3,2), (c_1\\mathcal I_1,c_2\\mathcal I_2) = (3,2), and the ranking reverses: 3>2. 3>2. Therefore an action ranking without canonical cross-branch normalization is nonidentifiable. \\boxed{ \\text{an action ranking without canonical cross-branch normalization is nonidentifiable.} } AUTO_LOCK NO-GO UNNORMALIZED_SOURCE_TO_HODGE_MAPS_CAN_REVERSE_PAIRING_SOURCE_ACTION_RANKING_NO_GO_v0.1 5. Existing action no-gos remain active The current response audit already locks: Jν=π∥Pνx∥2 J_\\nu=\\pi\\|P_\\nu x\\|^2 has no q/Hq/H response argument. Therefore current canonical Hodge action is response-blind. The same audit locks lifted loop action and event contraction as source-late for pre-event response selection. Thus adding a gate mask or using a post-event action difference to choose the source would create a new source law and violate causal ordering. AUTO_LOCK NO-GO CURRENT_O09_ACTION_CANNOT_BE_RETROFITTED_AS_PRE_EVENT_PAIRING_SOURCE_SELECTOR_v0.1 6. Lawful development path: typed action bundle A lawful extension can preserve provenance without falsely scalarizing the branches. Define a source-action packet ℑsrc=(ℐO09,ℐBG,ℐ∂,ℐdefect,ℐtransport), \\boxed{ \\mathfrak I_{\\mathrm src} = \\left( \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm O09}, \\mathcal I_{BG}, \\mathcal I_{\\partial}, \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm defect}, \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm transport} \\right), } where each component remains undefined until its own native source-to-action map is independently derived. This is a typed direct-product ledger, not an additive scalar action. Do not write ℐtotal=ℐO09+cBGℐBG+c∂ℐ∂+⋯ \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm total} = \\mathcal I_{\\mathrm O09} + c_{BG}\\mathcal I_{BG} + c_\\partial\\mathcal I_\\partial+\\cdots unless every coefficient and unit map is source-derived. AUTO_LOCK PAIRING_SOURCE_ACTION_PACKET_MUST_PRESERVE_BRANCH_PROVENANCE_UNTIL_COMMON_ACTION_MAP_IS_DERIVED_v0.1 AUTO_FREEZE ARBITRARY_WEIGHTED_SUM_OF_TYPED_PAIRING_SOURCE_ACTIONS_USED_AS_SELECTOR_v0.1 7. Current verdict The attempted source-selecting action does not close as a unique scalar law. What closes is the exact interface theorem: source selection by O09⇒canonical pre-event source-to-Hodge maps + common normalization. \\boxed{ \\text{source selection by O09} \\Rightarrow \\text{canonical pre-event source-to-Hodge maps + common normalization}. } Those maps are currently absent. Therefore O09 source-selecting pairing action=OPEN. \\boxed{ \\text{O09 source-selecting pairing action}=\\text{OPEN}. } The burden-gradient branch remains the current executable source by source completeness, not because O09 minimizes or selects it. Physical promotion remains 0. UD_PROVENANCE_LEDGER_ADDENDUM_LATENT_CROSSING_O09_SELECTOR_v0.1.mdUD Provenance Ledger Addendum — Latent Crossing / O09 Selector v0.1 Date: 2026-09-14 Physical promotion: 0 ID Object Exact form Claim bin Status Next gate LC01 one-pair pure latent crossing sign fixed T=1T=1: sgn(Nadd−Nsink)=sgnΔRp\\operatorname{sgn}(N_{\\mathrm add}-N_{\\mathrm sink})=\\operatorname{sgn}\\Delta R_p EXACT_CONDITIONAL AUTO_LOCK extend only with new integrity/source theorem LC02 instantaneous Q216Q216 zero-crossing polarity Rp=0⇒Ṙp=0R_p=0\\Rightarrow\\dot R_p=0 for smooth nonnegative witness LOCKED_NO_GO AUTO_LOCK use one-sided/finite history LC03 integrity-only rank changes ΔL=0\\Delta L=0 can still give A−S=±1A-S=\\pm1 LOCKED_NO_GO AUTO_LOCK preserve Q219 typing LC04 OP03 signed support vs latent witness rate no universal sign identity; exact opposite-sign Hodge witness LOCKED_NO_GO AUTO_LOCK independent sign bridge AS01 O09 source-selector interface canonical pre-event Jα:Xα→ℋO09J_\\alpha:X_\\alpha\\to\\mathcal H_{\\mathrm O09} required EXACT_INTERNAL AUTO_LOCK derive branch maps AS02 source-map normalization arbitrary scales can reverse action ranki